msgstr "真机可用"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-public_hi.md:12
#: b88ae3be1c26491ca4b408c7dd3da036
msgid ""
"**ARX Lift 2S** (full-body) and **Acone** / **AC One** (dual-arm) use "
"[arx-ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arx-ros2-control) "
"(CAN). **HighTorque Panthera HT** uses [ht-"
"ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ht-ros2-control) (serial). "
"See [ARX Lift "
"2S](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) and "
"[HighTorque Panthera "
"HT](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)."
msgstr ""
"**方舟无限 Lift 2S**（全身）和 **Acone** / **AC One**（双臂）使用 [arx-"
"ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arx-ros2-control)（CAN）。**高擎"
" Panthera HT** 使用 [ht-ros2-control](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/ht-"
"ros2-control)（串口）。见 [方舟无限 Lift "
"2S](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) 与 [高擎"
" Panthera "
"HT](../../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。"

