#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-public_hi.md:52
#: 6ef9b7bc8c524cc48113af5940b44389
msgid ""
"Marvin SDK driver-layer plugin (M6 and related). Plugin: "
"`marvin_ros2_control/MarvinHardware`. Command interfaces are joint "
"**`position` only**. Compliance is vendor `ctrl_mode` (`POSITION` / "
"`JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / `POWER_OFF`) plus `joint_k_gains` "
"/ `joint_d_gains`. USB-dongle 夹爪 / 灵巧手 use [Modbus](#modbus) or "
"[CAN](#can), not this package."
msgstr ""
"Marvin SDK 驱动层插件（M6 等）。插件：`marvin_ros2_control/MarvinHardware`。命令接口只有关节 **`position`**。柔顺靠厂商 "
"`ctrl_mode`（`POSITION` / `JOINT_IMPEDANCE` / `CART_IMPEDANCE` / `POWER_OFF`）以及 "
"`joint_k_gains` / `joint_d_gains`。USB 转接的夹爪 / 灵巧手走 [Modbus](#modbus) 或 [CAN](#can)，不在本包。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/hardware/1-public_hi.md:54
#: 9d6840462857457686e27d270ddef6cc
msgid ""
"Tool-dynamics / 负载辨识 wizard: `ros2 run marvin_ros2_control "
"tool_dyn_identify_wizard`. VR path: [VR "
"Teleoperation](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)."
msgstr ""
"工具动力学 / 负载辨识向导：`ros2 run marvin_ros2_control tool_dyn_identify_wizard`。VR 路径：[VR "
"遥操作](../../2-how_to/5-teleoperation/6-vr_teleop.md)。"

